---

This repository contains Evideris-derived artifacts (competencies, EPAs, evidence
criteria, competency assessments, and primary-source scoring tools) built on top
of the ESGE source-canonical schema at
https://github.com/Evideris-Systems/esge-curriculum-schema (CC BY 4.0).

The source-canonical schema is freely reusable. This derived layer represents
Evideris's design work — atomic-skill decomposition, accreditation evidence
criteria, EPA frameworks — and is licenced separately under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.
